    "text": "Carbon monoxide combines with haemoglobin to form carboxyhaemoglobin.&nbsp;High concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></math>leads to stiffness of flower buds.&nbsp;&nbsp;Polychlorinated biphenyls, are highly toxic industrial compounds.&nbsp;Pyrus and Vitis can metabolise nitrogen oxide.",
